{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-afd0ca97cb9f30d4","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Dashboard\n2\t\n3\t**Jira component**: Dashboard\n4\t**Maturity**: Stable (GA)\n5\t**Owning team**: RHOAI Dashboard\n6\t**Upstream**: opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard\n7\t**Midstream**: red-hat-data-services/odh-dashboard\n8\t**Konflux onboarded**: yes\n9\t\n10\t## Role in the platform\n11\t\n12\tSingle-pane web console for RHOAI. Surfaces data science projects, workbenches,\n13\tmodel serving, pipelines, and distributed workload status. User-facing enablement\n14\tof any component requires a Dashboard integration (navigation section, resource\n15\tlists, creation/edit forms, status views).\n16\t\n17\t## Dependencies\n18\t\n19\t- OpenShift OAuth for authentication and project-scoped RBAC\n20\t- Component backends via Kubernetes CRs (InferenceService, Notebook, PipelineRun,\n21\t  Workload) — the Dashboard reads and writes CRs, it owns no data plane\n22\t\n23\t## Interfaces\n24\t\n25\t- Kubernetes API only; no private component APIs\n26\t- Per-component feature flags and defaults via the OdhDashboardConfig CR\n27\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-867557591d0cc8ac","agent_id":"ac5ab4f93e9ccb280","session_id":"0a069a60-d094-4d49-bf51-a08d3019870c","uuid":"74f42b01-51cf-4209-bd97-9aa2aa30275c","timestamp":"2026-10-25T20:13:19.686Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-afd0ca97cb9f30d4","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9016"}
