benches with varying recent activity, the\n  report lists each idle workbench with its last-activity time, owner, and\n  reserved resources.\n- Given a project with no idle workbenches, the report shows an empty state\n  rather than an error.\n- The last-activity values shown in the report match the notebook controller's\n  activity tracking for the same workbenches (validation of the Notebooks\n  component as a passive data source).\n- An administrator can export the workbench report as CSV, and the exported\n  file contains the rows and columns displayed in the console.\n- The report offers no action that stops, deletes, or otherwise mutates a\n  workbench — reporting only.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-1 (P1): per-project idle-workbench report (last activity, owner,\n  reserved resources) sourced from the notebook controller's activity\n  tracking — fully covered by this epic.\n- HLR-3 (P2, bundled): CSV export of this report is included here rather than\n  a separate epic — the export edits the same report surface this epic builds,\n  so splitting would double-touch the same components.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32744,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-867557591d0cc8ac","agent_id":"ac5ab4f93e9ccb280","session_id":"0a069a60-d094-4d49-bf51-a08d3019870c","uuid":"292794d2-60c1-4059-b6c3-ea6e0772cadc","timestamp":"2026-10-25T20:15:56.864Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9016"}
