ta shown in the report matches Kubeflow Pipelines run\n  metadata for the same runs (validation of the Data Science Pipelines\n  component as a passive data source).\n- Given a project with no stale runs, the report shows an empty state rather\n  than an error.\n- An administrator can export the pipeline-run report as CSV, and the exported\n  file contains the rows and columns displayed in the console.\n- The report offers no action that deletes or otherwise mutates a run or its\n  artifacts — reporting only.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-2 (P1): stale pipeline-run report (completed runs older than a\n  configurable age with retained artifacts) sourced from Kubeflow Pipelines run\n  metadata — fully covered by this epic.\n- HLR-3 (P2, bundled): CSV export of this report is included here rather than\n  a separate epic — the export edits the same report surface this epic builds,\n  so splitting would double-touch the same components.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32744,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-867557591d0cc8ac","agent_id":"ac5ab4f93e9ccb280","session_id":"0a069a60-d094-4d49-bf51-a08d3019870c","uuid":"946a6fe1-a97c-4fed-998d-72e7a2828b7e","timestamp":"2026-10-25T20:16:02.558Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9016"}
