the displayed rows and\n50\t  columns.\n51\t- Empty-state handling for projects with no stale runs.\n52\t- No reclamation, deletion, or other mutating actions on runs or artifacts from\n53\t  the report (automated reclamation is out of scope for the strategy).\n54\t\n55\t## Acceptance Criteria\n56\t\n57\t- Given a project containing completed pipeline runs of varying ages, the\n58\t  report lists the runs older than the configured age, with their completion\n59\t  metadata and retained artifacts.\n60\t- The stale-age threshold is configurable, and changing it changes which runs\n61\t  the report lists.\n62\t- The run completion data shown in the report matches Kubeflow Pipelines run\n63\t  metadata for the same runs (validation of the Data Science Pipelines\n64\t  component as a passive data source).\n65\t- Given a project with no stale runs, the report shows an empty state rather\n66\t  than an error.\n67\t- An administrator can export the pipeline-run report as CSV, and the exported\n68\t  file contains the rows and columns displayed in the console.\n69\t- The report offers no action that deletes or otherwise mutates a run or its\n70\t  artifacts — reporting only.\n71\t\n72\t## HLR Traceability\n73\t\n74\t- HLR-2 (P1): stale pipeline-run report (completed runs older than a\n75\t  configurable age with retained artifacts) sourced from Kubeflow Pipelines run\n76\t  metadata — fully covered by this epic.\n77\t- HLR-3 (P2, bundled): CSV export of this report is included here rather than\n78\t  a separate epic — the export edits the same report surface this epic builds,\n79\t  so splitting would double-touch the same components.\n80\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b00bd1bb76f169d7","agent_id":"a56077b4d755d6c97","session_id":"0a069a60-d094-4d49-bf51-a08d3019870c","uuid":"b82ea2e0-3547-4a64-8dfb-97ec436ae332","timestamp":"2026-10-25T20:17:38.878Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-ad0b0ede00a12262","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"co